In <a href="https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/posts/117604177898784579">a post on his Truth Social platform</a> today, U.S. President Donald Trump said he thinks that Apple's chairman Tim Cook should become Nvidia's CEO.<br/>
<br/>
