Nvidia today <a href="https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-ceo-transition">announced</a> that Jensen Huang has resigned as the company's CEO effective immediately following reports that he had two extramarital affairs, including one that the U.S. government believes involved a spy working for the Chinese government. Nvidia has appointed its CFO Colette Kress as interim CEO.<br/>
<br/>
Nvidia's board of directors has initiated a search for a new CEO and said that it will consider both internal and external candidates.<br/>
<br/>
Cook stepped down as Apple's CEO on September 1 as part of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/20/tim-cook-stepping-down/">a planned transition</a>, and he now serves as the company's executive chairman.<br/>
<br/>
There is no indication that Cook actually wants to be Nvidia's CEO.<br/>
<br/>
